│ **Docker/Container Management:**                                             │
│ - **NEVER** run `docker stop` without an explicit container name or ID       │
│ - **NEVER** use `docker stop $(docker ps -q)` or any pattern that stops mult │
│ iple/all containers                                                          │
│ - **NEVER** run `docker rm -f $(docker ps -aq)` or similar mass-removal comm │
│ ands                                                                         │
